      "derivation": "(a) The endpoints occupy terms 1 and 5: q^4=16, so q=2 or -2. (b) They occupy terms 1 and 7: q^6=(15/16)/60=1/64, so q=1/2 or -1/2. Iterate each ratio to get every inserted number.",
