    {
      "exercise": "294",
      "derivation": "(a) Multiply by the reciprocal: (-16/8)*x^(4n+7-3n-5)*y^(2-3)=-2*x^(n+2)/y. (b) Constants: 81^3*5^4/(25^3*27^4)=3^12*5^4/(5^6*3^12)=1/25. Power: 3*(4n-1)-4*(3n-1)=1. Result a/25.",
      "parts": [
