    {
      "exercise": "295",
      "derivation": "(a) Factor out 4^(n-2): 4^(n-2)*(4^2-1)=15*4^(n-2). (b) Write 9^n=3^(2n), then factor out 3^(2n-1): 3^(2n-1)*(3-1)=2*3^(2n-1).",
      "parts": [
