    },
    {
      "exercise": "296",
      "derivation": "(a) Numerator=9^(n-1)*(9-7)=2*9^(n-1), so divide by 8 to get 9^(n-1)/4. (b) Numerator=3^(2n-1)*(9-1)=8*3^(2n-1); divide by 4*3^n to get 2*3^(n-1).",
